From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Reid Havens <info@analyticendeavors.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:42:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 155/191] [ae-patch] Let Settings > Chat choose what a session
 shows when it opens, with the session rail as the default

Sessions opened with the workspace panel restored, so the rail closed to make room for it. The "Open the session rail in every session" switch becomes a three-way choice: Session rail (new default; a restored panel starts closed on a desktop), Both when they fit (the switch on), Workspace panel (the switch off). A file, agents or comment link still opens the panel. A saved switch that was off reads as Workspace panel.
